[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 13622.469, "timestamp": "03:47:02", "text": "うん。また明日はN4のようなものがあり、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13625.75, "timestamp": "03:47:05", "text": "えっと、先生はテスト用紙をやっています"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13627.59, "timestamp": "03:47:07", "text": "N4。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13630.309, "timestamp": "03:47:10", "text": "朝の配信をしないといけないし、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13632.309, "timestamp": "03:47:12", "text": "練習する"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13634.63, "timestamp": "03:47:14", "text": "そして彼は私に、すべてを勉強するように言った"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13637.59, "timestamp": "03:47:17", "text": "N4レベルの漢字とか。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13640.522, "timestamp": "03:47:20", "text": "私は苦労しています"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13644.309, "timestamp": "03:47:24", "text": "[鼻を鳴らす]漢字のために。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13646.15, "timestamp": "03:47:26", "text": "ええ、明日は復習します"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13657.99, "timestamp": "03:47:37", "text": "[笑い]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13660.95, "timestamp": "03:47:40", "text": "立ち寄らなければなりませんね。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13669.99, "timestamp": "03:47:49", "text": "配信のお知らせ。これは何ですか？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13677.03, "timestamp": "03:47:57", "text": "えっと"}]